    "herhub_special_backgroup_EDc4aD": {
      "type": "herhub-special-backgroup",
      "blocks": {
        "text_TTzbwR": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<h1>Self-Awareness: <br/>The Foundation of Emotional Wellbeing</h1>",
            "heading_width": 495,
            "text_width": 490,
            "text": "<p>Women are more sensitive to stress than men. It often builds quietly, surfacing as poor sleep, anxiety, mood swings, weight changes, elevated heart rate, or irregular menstrual cycles—your body’s early warning signs. </p><p><a href=\"/products/luna\" title=\"FANY Luna Classic Smartwatch\">FANY Luna</a>'s advanced biosensors monitor key indicators like HRV and EDA, transforming subtle shifts into meaningful insights about stress and emotional balance. More than data, it’s 24/7 feedback—helping you understand your body and nurture your wellbeing.</p>"
          }
        },
        "image_FY9rYx": {
