          "settings": {
            "heading": "<h1>Track Your  Cycle, <br/>Manage Your Health <br/>& Schedule </h1>",
            "heading_width": 600,
            "text_width": 700,
            "text": "<p><a href=\"https://womenshealth.gov/menstrual-cycle/your-menstrual-cycle-and-your-health\" title=\"https://womenshealth.gov/menstrual-cycle/your-menstrual-cycle-and-your-health\">U.S. Department of Health and Human Services </a>research confirms women’s menstrual cycles are closely tied to health: Cycle-regulating hormones affect emotions and physical condition; menstrual issues may signal health risks and impact pregnancy. <br/><a href=\"/products/luna\" title=\"FANY Luna Classic Smartwatch\">FANY Luna</a> tracks your cycle, ovulation, and emotional and physical changes, turning data into insights. Plan work, family, and workouts more effectively, while staying aware of period-related mood shifts for timely self-care.</p>"
          }
        }
